        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The target is Delaware's August 2026 state row in CMS dataset 5abea2e0-3f8e-4b49-a50d-d63d5fd9103c, using original (O) submission outcomes and first-publication resolution. The ledger does not explicitly identify the denominator. This forecast follows CMS's published ex parte rate convention: ex parte renewals divided by all beneficiaries due for renewal, including pending outcomes. The June 2026 snapshot's state table on page 30 uses that convention and reports Delaware's 15,157 due and 36% ex parte rate."
